# Public website

- Copy is bundled from `src/content/site.json`. Do not fetch it at runtime. Service and about pages are `pages[]`. [why: convention]
- Components must render the same on the server and the client. Read `window`, `matchMedia`, and `navigator` through `useSyncExternalStore` with a server snapshot. See `MotionProvider.tsx` and `ContactIcons.tsx`. [why: convention]
- `npm run build` pre-renders every route from `scripts/site-seo.ts` and fails a route without an `<h1>` or inline CSS. `PUBLIC_WWW_PRERENDER=0` skips it. [why: convention]
- Site events are pushed from `src/lib/analytics.ts` only after the GTM container loads. The event list must match `scripts/test_configure_public_analytics.py`. [why: convention]
- The apex redirect is the Cloudflare Worker `lx-software-apex-redirect`. Do not restore the dummy `192.0.2.1` A record. The HTTPS Single Redirect keeps the path; do not use a star destination. [why: convention]
- Phone numbers, personal inboxes, and street addresses stay out of source. The owner name in `site.owner` is the published exception. [why: 5da3336 hashed PII denylist]
